# Files that run inside Linux containers must keep LF line endings on every checkout. With
# core.autocrlf=true (the Windows default) they were checked out with CRLF; the image copies
# docker-entrypoint.sh as it is in the working tree, and "#!/bin/sh\r" makes the container fail
# to start with "exec docker-entrypoint.sh: no such file or directory".
*.sh        text eol=lf
Caddyfile   text eol=lf
Dockerfile  text eol=lf
